WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.318
With Google Translate or
its Cloud Translation API,

2
00:00:04.318 --> 00:00:07.022
you send text and build
the rest yourself.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:09.391
It translates text well,

4
00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:11.388
keeps HTML tags intact,

5
00:00:11.388 --> 00:00:12.781
and supports glossaries.

6
00:00:13.150 --> 00:00:16.366
General Translation understands
each string's context,

7
00:00:16.366 --> 00:00:18.234
and automates the whole workflow.

8
00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.926
Wrap the copy in a T component,

9
00:00:21.926 --> 00:00:24.003
with a note on what Save means here.

10
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.577
Values in a Var component,

11
00:00:26.577 --> 00:00:28.863
such as the discount,
are never sent.

12
00:00:29.650 --> 00:00:33.772
Then npx gt translate
writes German in your build,

13
00:00:33.772 --> 00:00:35.036
and reviewers edit it.

14
00:00:35.650 --> 00:00:38.145
Your team now ships
German with each release.
